WEBVTT

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.459
If you know where to go.

00:19:09.231 --> 00:19:12.193
Ah, Hagrid! The usual, I presume?

00:19:12.401 --> 00:19:16.280
No, thanks, Tom.
I'm on official Hogwarts business.

00:19:16.489 --> 00:19:19.575
Just helping Harry buy
his school supplies.

00:19:19.825 --> 00:19:23.371
Bless my soul. It's Harry Potter!

00:19:27.667 --> 00:19:31.087
Welcome back, Mr. Potter.
Welcome back.

00:19:31.337 --> 00:19:35.675
Doris crockford. I can't believe
I'm meeting you at last.

00:19:36.092 --> 00:19:41.389
Harry Potter. Can't tell you
how pleased I am to meet you.

00:19:41.597 --> 00:19:44.100
Hello, professor. I didn't see you.

00:19:44.350 --> 00:19:49.355
Professor quirrell will be your
defense against the dark arts teacher.

00:19:49.563 --> 00:19:51.941
Oh, nice to meet you.

00:19:52.233 --> 00:19:55.319
Fearfully fascinating subject.

00:19:55.528 --> 00:20:00.116
Not that you need it, eh, Potter?

00:20:01.075 --> 00:20:05.246
Yes, well, must be going now.
Lots to buy.

00:20:05.454 --> 00:20:07.206
Harry: Goodbye.

00:20:09.917 --> 00:20:13.462
- See, Harry? You're famous.
- But why am I famous?

00:20:13.713 --> 00:20:17.133
All those people,
how is it they know who I am?

00:20:17.383 --> 00:20:21.137
I'm not sure I'm the right person
to tell you that.

00:20:38.154 --> 00:20:41.949
Welcome, Harry, to diagon alley.
